    "Condition : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 18 September 2024, the use of 2 Spring Grove Road TW3 4BJ as two self-contained flats was lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\nThe applicant has provided sufficient information to evidence that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as two self-contained flats for a continuous period of four years."
